### PHASE 25: MENTOR BOOKING INTEGRITY

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@ownerToken = Bearer <PROJECT_OWNER_JWT>
@mentorToken = Bearer <MENTOR_JWT>
@owner2Token = Bearer <SECOND_OWNER_JWT>

### 1. Owner Cannot Book Self as Mentor (409 CANNOT_BOOK_SELF)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/book
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "mentor-profile-owner",
  "projectId": "proj-owned-by-self",
  "projectDescription": "Self mentorship attempt",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-06-12T10:00:00.000Z"
}

### 2. Owner Cannot Book Project Collaborator as Mentor (409 CANNOT_BOOK_OWN_PROJECT_MENTOR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/book
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "mentor-profile-collab",
  "projectId": "proj-with-collab-as-mentor",
  "projectDescription": "Collaborator mentor attempt",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-06-12T10:00:00.000Z"
}

### 3. Non-Live Project Cannot Be Booked (Draft / Closed / Completed / Deleted -> 409 PROJECT_NOT_BOOKABLE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/book
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "mentor-profile-1",
  "projectId": "proj-draft-1",
  "projectDescription": "Booking on draft project",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-06-12T10:00:00.000Z"
}

### 4. Book Valid Mentor Session on Live Project (201 Created, ClockService 30m hold)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/book
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "mentor-profile-1",
  "projectId": "proj-live-1",
  "projectDescription": "Architecture review and milestone sprint mentoring",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-06-12T10:00:00.000Z"
}

### 5. Mentor Time Overlap Rejected Without Other Project Name (409 MENTOR_TIME_CONFLICT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/book
Authorization: {{owner2Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "mentor-profile-1",
  "projectId": "proj-live-2",
  "projectDescription": "Overlapping 10:30 slot for same mentor",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-06-12T10:30:00.000Z"
}

### 6. Owner Time Overlap Rejected Across Mentors (409 OWNER_TIME_CONFLICT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/book
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "mentor-profile-4",
  "projectId": "proj-live-1b",
  "projectDescription": "Double booking owner schedule with second mentor",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-06-12T10:30:00.000Z"
}

### 7. Touching Back-to-Back Slot Allowed (11:00 immediately after 10:00-11:00 -> 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/book
Authorization: {{owner2Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "mentor-profile-1",
  "projectId": "proj-live-2",
  "projectDescription": "Back-to-back touching booking",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-06-12T11:00:00.000Z"
}

### 8. Confirm Payment (Re-runs assertBookable under Queue Locks, Idempotency-Key Supported)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/sess-1/pay
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: pay-key-phase25-1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9. Mentor Accept (Re-runs assertBookable under Queue Locks Before Assigning Mentor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/sess-1/accept
Authorization: {{mentorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
